7. 🛑 HIS 'COMES IN AND OUT' WAS ABOUT THE HIGHWAY, NOT THIS WINDOW.
====================================================================================================================
  "It's like vibration comes in and out WHILE HIGHWAY DRIVING and the ratchet-like
   oscillation shows up on top of it when it's happening, sometimes."
  Sections 1-6 used < 16 km/h because that is where he places GRINDING.  The BURST
  structure he describes is a HIGHWAY observation, so it must be tested there.
